  <section aria-labelledby="minimal-about">
    <h2 id="minimal-about">About</h2>
    <p>Hi, I’m Lee. I live in Atlanta, by way of the DC area. I’m interested in tools and how we use them.</p>
    <p>My training is in social science, and most of my work has been in public health and global health ethics. These days, I’m an independent consultant working through GOODNEIGHBOR on research, strategy, and design.</p>
    <p>For useful references and rabbit holes, see <a href="/shelf/">Stacks</a>. Updated irregularly.</p>
  </section>

